From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Telesphoreo <me@telesphoreo.me>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:52:54 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Bound NBT string visitors

Diagnostic and component NBT renderers could traverse unbounded wide or deep trees. Share a 1024-element budget across each complete render, cap depth at 64, and preserve a valid truncated SNBT prefix where applicable.

